{'symbol': 'TSN', 'date': '2023-02-09 18:00:00', 'title': 'TYSON FOODS ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'SPRINGDALE, ARK., FEB. 09, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF TYSON FOODS (NYSE: TSN), AT A MEETING ON FEB. 8, 2023, DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.48 PER SHARE ON CLASS A COMMON STOCK AND $0.432 PER SHARE ON CLASS B COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON JUNE 15, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 1, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'TSN', 'date': '2023-02-09 14:00:00', 'title': 'TYSON FOODS HOLDS 60TH ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': "SPRINGDALE, ARK., FEB. 09, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- TYSON FOODS (NYSE: TSN) HELD ITS 60TH ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS EARLIER TODAY AT ITS EMMA ST. LOCATION, THE SITE OF THE COMPANY'S ORIGINAL HEADQUARTERS, TO ADDRESS COMPANY BUSINESS FOLLOWING ITS FIRST QUARTER RESULTS."}